# No photograph may ever enter this repository.
#
# The benchmark set is the reason this file exists. Calibrating thresholds
# against real photographs means real photographs of real children sitting on
# someone's disk, next to a git checkout. One `git add -A` and they are public
# forever.
#
# So the benchmark lives outside version control entirely, and this file makes
# the common accident impossible rather than merely discouraged. Tests guard
# the rest -- see tests/test_skill_contract.py::NoPhotographsTests.

benchmark/

*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.webp
*.heic
*.heif
*.tif
*.tiff
*.bmp

*.raw
*.cr2
*.cr3
*.nef
*.arw
*.orf
*.rw2
*.dng
*.raf
*.pef
*.srw
*.x3f
*.3fr
*.mos
*.mrw
*.erf
*.kdc
*.dcr

*.psd
*.psb
*.xcf
*.lrtemplate
*.dcp
